{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18107621","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18107621","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1810762101:0":{"text":"Estrilda places the cure into Rain's hands, but he hesitates.","source_cn":"爱丝将解药交到了里纳手中。然而，里纳却似乎有些犹豫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E5E3C54218FCA8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1810762102:1":{"text":"What is it? Is there something wrong with the medicine?","source_cn":"怎么了？这瓶药有什么不对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x700B78B3C1061D53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1810762103:1":{"text":"No... I'm just... hesitating.","source_cn":"不……不是。我只是有点……犹豫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03AE6A7586BE86EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1810762103":{"text":"No... I'm just... hesitating.","source_cn":"不……不是。我只是有点……犹豫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03AE6A7586BE86EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1810762104:1":{"text":"I'm afraid that once I remember, I'll understand why Thane stopped me.","source_cn":"……我害怕恢复记忆以后，就会理解你和瑟恩所做的一切。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9867B90CD9EF2CF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1810762105:1":{"text":"And if that happens... it feels like I'm betraying Baba Muriel.","source_cn":"可是这样……或许对穆婆婆不公平。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E7D007E36FA8231","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1810762106:1":{"text":"I don't ask for your forgiveness, Baden. The moment I decided to stop you, I accepted the consequences.","source_cn":"我不奢求你的理解和原谅。下定决心阻拦你的那一刻，我就已...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3F7FD8F5EFD785B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1810762107:1":{"text":"You could refuse the cure. You could continue living as \"Rain\".","source_cn":"你也可以拒绝恢复记忆，以“里纳”的身份继续活下去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4B57456786B16EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1810762108:1":{"text":"...\nYou know perfectly well that \"Baden\" wouldn't make that choice.","source_cn":"………………\\n你明知道“巴登”不会这样做。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9D72C8AD238A2D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1810762109:1":{"text":"Whatever you choose, I stand by it. I swore an oath to protect Estrilda and House Rayne until my heart stops beating.","source_cn":"无论你作何选择，我都不会有怨言。我已发誓守护爱丝和瑞恩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x516A1B4F3F1764E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1810762110:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1810762111:0":{"text":"Mr. Baden... No, Mr. Rain. If you don't mind, please hear the perspective of a Graveborn.","source_cn":"巴登先生……不，里纳先生。若你不介意，请听听我作为亡灵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B78D79AB13E0643","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1810762112:0":{"text":"I don't know the full story, but I know this. Baba Muriel's sacrifice was her own choice, born entirely from her heart. She wanted to save you.","source_cn":"虽然不清楚事情的具体经过，但我想，穆婆婆所做的一切必定...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C23C86BA8942DA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1810762113:0":{"text":"Her devotion to you was a truth written plain as day for everyone at the Repair House to see.","source_cn":"毕竟她对你的爱护，每一位修缮屋的客人都有目共睹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x837FF8EBFBBA2DCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1810762114:1":{"text":"That's exactly why I can't forgive myself!","source_cn":"就是因为这样，我才无法原谅自己……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA75BFDC342FBAAFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1810762115:1":{"text":"I understand your pain. But death is not the final curtain.","source_cn":"我明白你的痛苦。但这不是生命的终点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x387D53938AB0A775","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1810762116:1":{"text":"Just as death is not the end for the living... fading away isn't the end for the Graveborn. <style=\"highlight\">To be forgotten is the only true end.</style>","source_cn":"就像死亡不是生者的终点，消散也不是亡灵的终点。<sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x666613B06C013092","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1810762117:1":{"text":"To be forgotten...","source_cn":"遗忘……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F7A4A3AAB1BA699","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1810762118:1":{"text":"Yes. Just like in my play, Lost Voice. As long as you remember her, her soul and her will live on through you.","source_cn":"是的。如同我所演出的《消逝之声》那样，只要你记得穆婆婆...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77B8B134F3258053","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1810762119:1":{"text":"Your life is the treasure she gave everything to protect. If you waste it away in despair, her spirit will truly weep.","source_cn":"你的生命，你的人生，是她拼尽全力也要保护的最宝贵之物。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DD0EC65C26231AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1810762120:1":{"text":"Honor her sacrifice. Reclaim your past, carry her memory forward, and let the warmth she gave you bridge the gap between life and death for others.","source_cn":"请不要辜负她的牺牲。找回属于你的过去，带着对她的思念活...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F1B5CDB2F34CC6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1810762121:1":{"text":"Bridge the gap between life and death...","source_cn":"跨越生死……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD475DE7F0972BC30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1810762122:1":{"text":"... I see.","source_cn":"……我明白了。<key:dialog803>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x958508793A16C8F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"Why?","source_cn":"为什么？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5C3D3E6FA800A611","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Why?","female":"Why?","variant_male_record_index":"93357","variant_female_record_index":"93358","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:旁白":{"text":"Narrator","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:爱丝特瑞达":{"text":"Estrilda","source":"爱丝特瑞达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:里纳":{"text":"Rain","source":"里纳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瑟恩":{"text":"Thane","source":"瑟恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:塞涅":{"text":"Senea","source":"塞涅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":25,"localized_text_count":24,"speaker_count":5}}